  m_text: The more they'll be drained, the weaker they will be. You need to stop
    it from happening and restore luck. If I bless you now, you will possess enough
    luck to fight back against those machines, and I will stay by your side and make
    sure the odds are in your favor.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
