      m_Calls: []
  m_text: ... Oh, I see, my presence may shock you a bit, does it not ? I believe
    we've not met before. It's been so long since I've spoken to your kind... I present
    myself, Maneki, the Goddess of Luck that once inhabited those lands. And your
    name is Thirteen, quite unique.
