    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: You're exactly the cat I'm looking for, Thirteen. I have fled in the past,
    burdened by the sight of what my home had become, I let your people lose their
    way in favor of more power, and now I fear I will also lose myself if I let it
    happen longer. Those machines, and whoever is behind them, have been draining
    the luck of my precious followers for far too long.
